  "description": "Im Han-sae has never liked Ji On-young. Not since their school days. He hated how Ji On-young was always one step ahead of him. One sweltering summer day, while waiting for a friend who never showed up, Han-sae ended up going to an escape room with Ji On-young. Ji On-young claimed he’d never tried one before—perfect. Han-sae thought it was the perfect chance to show off his brilliance.\n\n[There’s only one way to escape!]\n\n…Yeah. This wasn’t exactly what he’d planned to show off.\n\n---\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/1483020428)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://bomtoon.com/detail/pushinside), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/push_unlock), [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/1561013234), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10859739), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000062376), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=240332)",
